00:22:43,351 --> 00:22:45,094
So what could've triggered him?

275
00:22:45,443 --> 00:22:47,728
Um, electric currents,

276
00:22:48,245 --> 00:22:50,414
..intense physical trauma,

277
00:22:54,683 --> 00:22:56,515
What about a person?

278
00:22:56,931 --> 00:22:58,900
A person?

279
00:23:00,744 --> 00:23:03,747
This, I'm not sure.

280
00:23:05,674 --> 00:23:08,642
Either way, can you come see Tao Sor often for the time being?

281
00:23:08,874 --> 00:23:11,405
In case something happens, and you could quickly tell me.

282
00:23:12,936 --> 00:23:13,861
Can do.

283
00:23:15,806 --> 00:23:17,474
But you gotta treat me to dinner tonight

284
00:23:17,475 --> 00:23:19,876
I'll get a you huge order of lobster.

285
00:23:19,877 --> 00:23:21,445
One this big.

286
00:23:22,780 --> 00:23:25,282
- Okay, cheers!
- Cheers!

287
00:23:48,772 --> 00:23:53,209
Tao Sor, my name's Dr. Kleun, your on hand doctor

288
00:23:53,210 --> 00:23:56,213
I probably don't have to introduce myself, do I?

289
00:23:56,881 --> 00:23:59,883
Everyone remembers me...

290
00:24:01,172 --> 00:24:03,141
...but I can't remember anyone.

291
00:24:03,943 --> 00:24:06,413
Are you a real doctor? I don't even know.

292
00:24:16,634 --> 00:24:18,735
This picture...

293
00:24:18,736 --> 00:24:20,437
is the first drawing you did.

294
00:24:36,654 --> 00:24:38,922
And this one,

295
00:24:39,011 --> 00:24:42,014
is of the place you like to go exercise at.

296
00:24:44,639 --> 00:24:47,642
Even if you tell me, I still wouldn't remember.

297
00:24:50,100 --> 00:24:51,968
Even if you can't remember things,

298
00:24:51,969 --> 00:24:55,095
it doesn't mean that you can't live life.

299
00:24:56,040 --> 00:24:57,775
Doctor?

300
00:24:59,131 --> 00:25:01,116
Do I have a chance to remember everyone?

301
00:25:01,512 --> 00:25:03,328
I still wake up and recall

302
00:25:04,448 --> 00:25:06,850
how much my parents love me

303
00:25:07,885 --> 00:25:09,954
what I did at the beach,

304
00:25:14,058 --> 00:25:16,760
I want to have memories like everyone else.

305
00:25:22,833 --> 00:25:25,488
Whether or not you remember anything,

306
00:25:26,088 --> 00:25:28,838
I want to let you know,

307
00:25:28,839 --> 00:25:32,542
that everyone in your family loves and cares for you very much

308
00:25:32,543 --> 00:25:36,981
and they'll take care of you, no matter what happens.

309
00:25:53,085 --> 00:25:56,889
Next time, if you need me to pick you up, you can just tell me.

310
00:25:58,206 --> 00:25:59,628
Could I?

311
00:26:00,226 --> 00:26:03,282
Of course! I'm your cousin, after all!

312
00:26:03,307 --> 00:26:04,741
Yeah?

313
00:26:04,742 --> 00:26:08,077
I've never felt that way.

314
00:26:08,078 --> 00:26:10,313
You sure are blunt.

315
00:26:10,739 --> 00:26:14,384
It's true! When you were here, I was still really young.

316
00:26:14,906 --> 00:26:16,119
How could I remember anything.

317
00:26:16,373 --> 00:26:19,355
And you never came back to visit again.

318
00:26:19,695 --> 00:26:21,658
How could I feel that way?

319
00:26:21,984 --> 00:26:24,360
My mom, she...

320
00:26:24,361 --> 00:26:26,363
has some bad history with this place.

321
00:26:27,197 --> 00:26:29,667
So my family never came back.

322
00:26:31,201 --> 00:26:32,869
Then, no problem.

323
00:26:32,870 --> 00:26:35,873
We can just get close now, don't you think?

324
00:26:43,347 --> 00:26:45,248
You serving me curry too?

325
00:26:46,117 --> 00:26:47,483
Just the broth is enough!

326
00:26:47,916 --> 00:26:50,660
Let's see, if you want the fish so much

327
00:26:50,934 --> 00:26:52,744
then go ahead!

328
00:26:53,032 --> 00:26:54,732
So you could be smart like everyone else.

329
00:26:54,917 --> 00:26:57,727
What? I'm already smart!

330
00:26:58,093 --> 00:27:00,253
There! Eat some vegetables too!

331
00:27:02,599 --> 00:27:04,068
I guess so...

332
00:27:09,394 --> 00:27:10,394
Siw!

333
00:27:12,353 --> 00:27:15,356
About Sang...

334
00:27:16,389 --> 00:27:20,894
...when did she become so cold hearted?

335
00:27:22,456 --> 00:27:26,856
That case? She's actually very sensitive, you know?

336
00:27:26,857 --> 00:27:33,297
But when she's in front of Dad, she has put on a strong act.

337
00:27:39,937 --> 00:27:43,239
In that case, you can take care of the bill.

338
00:27:43,572 --> 00:27:46,575
Wait, wait, wait. Did you get me out here to treat you dinner?

339
00:27:56,028 --> 00:27:58,522
You still enjoy Orange Curry, don't you?

340
00:28:00,590 --> 00:28:02,124
I don't like it.

341
00:28:02,258 --> 00:28:07,163
Sang makes us have Orange Curry for breakfast, lunch and dinner.

342
00:28:09,609 --> 00:28:13,846
What else would you have me eat? All I have everyday is Orange Curry.

343
00:28:14,359 --> 00:28:17,362
Well, aside from Sang, you also have me.

344
00:28:17,929 --> 00:28:19,796
I raised you off of Orange Curry.

345
00:28:19,953 --> 00:28:23,423
Wait for it, a whole year full of Orange Curry for sure.

346
00:28:29,927 --> 00:28:32,745
Kim, we gotta go. Get the bill!

347
00:28:32,933 --> 00:28:34,423
What's going on, I haven't eaten yet!

348
00:28:34,655 --> 00:28:35,956
Hurry up and eat!

349
00:28:36,103 --> 00:28:38,505
Waiter? Get us the bill!

350
00:28:46,236 --> 00:28:49,238
Hello, Ms. Suli, thank you for the stars

351
00:28:49,239 --> 00:28:52,643
you sent a whole star shower, that's so nice! Thank you!

352
00:28:55,112 --> 00:28:59,315
Okay everyone, we're now gonna go into the horoscopes for Leos.

353
00:28:59,316 --> 00:29:03,019
This week, fortune for love will be strong!

354
00:29:03,020 --> 00:29:05,189
You might just meet the one.

355
00:29:13,664 --> 00:29:14,865
But...

356
00:29:15,399 --> 00:29:19,936
You have to put in a little effort, you can't just sit around being pretty.

357
00:29:19,937 --> 00:29:22,472
You might meet someone who hurts you.

358
00:29:27,244 --> 00:29:31,581
What can I do to see the person I like? We're in different places.

359
00:29:31,582 --> 00:29:34,370
They're an influencer that does fortune telling,

360
00:29:34,528 --> 00:29:37,965
and I'm an influencer doing lifestyle content in Phuket.

361
00:29:41,391 --> 00:29:44,427
If you want to see her, you have to go to her

362
00:29:44,428 --> 00:29:48,631
you’ll have to find a way to make her come to you.

363
00:29:48,632 --> 00:29:51,067
And since she’s an influencer

364
00:29:51,068 --> 00:29:56,006
using work as a reason would probably be the most effective.

365
00:29:56,506 --> 00:29:59,509
Do you want me to help think of a solution?

366
00:29:59,843 --> 00:30:02,846
No need, I think I figured it out.

367
00:30:08,085 --> 00:30:10,887
As for Virgos,

368
00:30:10,888 --> 00:30:15,192
your luck in romance might not be so good.

369
00:31:34,338 --> 00:31:37,341
Kim! Where you going so early?

370
00:31:38,709 --> 00:31:43,347
I thinking of getting something to eat.

371
00:31:52,356 --> 00:31:56,859
Oh, Sang. We're about to enter low season

372
00:31:57,049 --> 00:32:00,718
I was thinking if getting some influencers to promote our boat would be good?

373
00:32:01,198 --> 00:32:02,529
I think it's a waste.

374
00:32:03,367 --> 00:32:07,337
Another thing, if we're entering the monsoon season, there still wouldn't be any clients.

375
00:32:07,904 --> 00:32:09,305
Siw!

376
00:32:09,306 --> 00:32:10,840
I like your idea.

377
00:32:10,841 --> 00:32:12,074
- Really?
- Yeah!

378
00:32:12,075 --> 00:32:14,244
Are you going to use it to promote your own business?

379
00:32:17,247 --> 00:32:19,383
And why do we have to promote others?

380
00:32:22,419 --> 00:32:25,154
Just promote the family's boat.

381
00:32:25,155 --> 00:32:27,424
So that means you're in?

382
00:32:28,925 --> 00:32:30,760
Come up with a plan of action then

383
00:32:30,761 --> 00:32:33,062
so I can present it to Dad.

384
00:32:33,063 --> 00:32:34,297
Will do!

385
00:32:37,834 --> 00:32:40,337
And don't accepting any work elsewhere.

386
00:33:11,501 --> 00:33:13,603
Are you drawing me right now?

387
00:33:22,212 --> 00:33:25,215
If it's not okay with you, I can get rid of it.

388
00:33:27,017 --> 00:33:29,318
Just wait a minute.

389
00:33:29,319 --> 00:33:30,786
It looks good.

390
00:33:30,787 --> 00:33:32,254
Let me take it

391
00:33:32,255 --> 00:33:34,423
I'll buy it off you

392
00:33:34,424 --> 00:33:35,524
I won't sell.

393
00:33:35,525 --> 00:33:36,827
What are you, an indie artist?

394
00:33:37,661 --> 00:33:40,964
But if you want it, I could give it to you.

395
00:33:42,566 --> 00:33:44,767
Sure. Then...

396
00:33:44,768 --> 00:33:46,502
..sign it for me too,

397
00:33:46,503 --> 00:33:49,172
in case you get famous one day and I could sell it.

398
00:33:50,574 --> 00:33:52,542
Alright..

399
00:33:53,510 --> 00:33:55,145
Wanna go surfing?

400
00:33:57,414 --> 00:34:00,417
Nah, I don't know how.

401
00:34:01,184 --> 00:34:03,053
If you can't, then you should try learning!

402
00:34:03,854 --> 00:34:06,857
Come on, I'll show you how it's done.

403
00:34:14,931 --> 00:34:17,934
I've never been in the ocean.

404
00:34:22,581 --> 00:34:25,584
Are you afraid of the ocean?

405
00:34:31,348 --> 00:34:38,388
Try it out, I'll bring you out there. Trust me.

406
00:34:56,206 --> 00:34:57,761
Is that really a good idea?

407
00:34:59,153 --> 00:35:00,421
Why?

408
00:35:01,778 --> 00:35:04,147
I've never been in the ocean before.

409
00:35:07,066 --> 00:35:10,666
In that case, there might be another way.

410
00:35:11,177 --> 00:35:12,654
What way?

411
00:35:12,988 --> 00:35:14,890
I'll show you.

412
00:35:29,176 --> 00:35:33,938
I don't know if you've been here or not, but I think

413
00:35:33,963 --> 00:35:38,234
this place will make you feel like the ocean isn't a scary place.

414
00:35:39,949 --> 00:35:40,806
Ready?

415
00:35:45,788 --> 00:35:47,523
Scared?

416
00:35:55,821 --> 00:35:58,189
Gradually start breathing to the rhythm of my voice.

417
00:35:59,110 --> 00:36:00,844
Let your heart be free.

418
00:36:02,005 --> 00:36:03,740
Breath in,

419
00:36:05,306 --> 00:36:07,943
breathe out.

420
00:36:07,944 --> 00:36:10,846
Breath in,

421
00:36:10,847 --> 00:36:12,815
breathe out.

422
00:36:12,816 --> 00:36:15,184
Breath in,

423
00:36:15,185 --> 00:36:18,188
breathe out.

424
00:36:37,601 --> 00:36:39,642
Now let's go inside.

425
00:36:39,643 --> 00:36:42,646
If it's too much, close your eyes.

426
00:36:51,588 --> 00:36:53,572
Follow me, okay?

427
00:37:00,606 --> 00:37:04,501
Another step, go foward a little.

428
00:37:08,358 --> 00:37:10,840
And now, open your eyes.

429
00:37:59,622 --> 00:38:03,360
You see? Inside, it's breathtaking.

430
00:38:23,406 --> 00:38:26,961
In Bangkok, I barely had any time to go anywhere.

431
00:38:28,116 --> 00:38:30,808
So I came to the aquarium in secret alot.

432
00:38:37,838 --> 00:38:41,971
I don't know if I've been here before either.

433
00:38:43,693 --> 00:38:45,904
I might have, but..

434
00:38:48,092 --> 00:38:51,095
I probably don't remember.

435
00:38:56,979 --> 00:38:59,982
Aren't you curious why?

436
00:39:03,556 --> 00:39:06,030
Let me tell you a secret.

437
00:39:06,055 --> 00:39:10,493
Actually, you and I have met before.

438
00:39:16,813 --> 00:39:20,145
Alright, I've told you my secret.

439
00:39:20,170 --> 00:39:23,706
Now, it's your turn.

440
00:39:32,648 --> 00:39:35,651
My secret is...

441
00:39:37,731 --> 00:39:39,439
I can't remember yesterday's events.

442
00:39:40,561 --> 00:39:43,927
But I can remember some pieces.

443
00:39:45,049 --> 00:39:47,928
Like cooking,

444
00:39:48,585 --> 00:39:51,555
drawing, but...

445
00:39:52,883 --> 00:39:55,325
You saying that we know each other,

446
00:39:56,091 --> 00:39:59,428
I don't know if it's true.

447
00:40:01,151 --> 00:40:03,134
Then...

448
00:40:04,413 --> 00:40:06,060
what else do you remember?

449
00:40:06,483 --> 00:40:09,486
Tell me about it.

450
00:40:16,828 --> 00:40:17,806
Oh!

451
00:40:18,950 --> 00:40:20,728
I really like Tao Sor snacks

452
00:40:21,731 --> 00:40:25,068
and I also like drawing.

453
00:40:26,357 --> 00:40:27,783
I think I'm afraid of the ocean.

454
00:40:28,170 --> 00:40:29,306
But...

455
00:40:32,194 --> 00:40:33,818
Now I'm not afraid anymore.

456
00:40:33,843 --> 00:40:37,112
Because...

457
00:40:37,113 --> 00:40:42,385
the bottom is kinda pretty, don't you think?

458
00:41:36,539 --> 00:41:38,808
Nown!

459
00:41:47,146 --> 00:41:48,138
I'm here.

460
00:41:57,727 --> 00:41:59,996
The cards really that bad?

461
00:42:01,931 --> 00:42:04,700
To be honest, yes.

462
00:42:04,701 --> 00:42:06,034
Both in your job and in your love life.

463
00:42:06,035 --> 00:42:08,470
Whatever you hope for, you won't receive.

464
00:42:08,471 --> 00:42:10,873
Whatever you hope against, you won't receive.

465
00:42:12,008 --> 00:42:16,813
So why did you have me promote your family's business?

